If you actually based in Rome and you'd like to use the tube, you need to download this app!
Metro Rome : Timetables & lines is easy to use and has got all the features that will allow you to use the tube at the best
That's all the features that the app has got:

- AUGMENTED REALITY:  with this new feature you can look around yourself for searching for the nearest tube station;

- MAPS FOR ALL THE STATIONS: you will be allowed to look in all the tube lines and get the nearest tube station;

- GET DIRECTIONS BY WALK AND DRIVE MODE: with this new update you will be allowed to get direction to a selected tube station straight away in the app;

- STREET VIEW: this awesome new feature will give you the best directions ever! You will get the Street View straight inside the app!

- INTEREST POINTS: Come and get all the interest points that you will need to look on near to the tube stations;

- TIMETABLES: you can always look in all the timetables but also downloaded, send or share it with your friends;

- OFFLINE MODE: Are you in an aeroplane mode? Don't worry about it, you will always look at the map;

What else do I need to tell you about it? 
Come and enjoy the app!

